{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Review of `988a4d2fa258222aef792a2a6afde9641b8c5228` against `feat/oos` at `f4299ac0cd777a2a964c1f197ae5ebf9841a4936`, including local uncommitted changes.\n\nNo newly confirmed routing correctness defect. Full acceptance remains unproven.\n\n## Standards\n\n0 substantive hard violations; 2 optional suggestions: remove the unused two-pass rebuild API/state and consolidate repeated reference-routing fixture code. [Standards report](https://github.com/vimkim/my-cubrid-docs/blob/08870b103aea34148f08bb9e5d9d9c496d4a4e11/cbrd-27089/review-988a4d2-codex/standards.md).\n\n## Spec\n\nThree acceptance gates remain open: complete SERVER_MODE lifecycle coverage, control-workload performance acceptance, and final integrated evidence. The existing timing results are inconclusive; passing standalone tests does not close these gates. [Spec report](https://github.com/vimkim/my-cubrid-docs/blob/08870b103aea34148f08bb9e5d9d9c496d4a4e11/cbrd-27089/review-988a4d2-codex/spec.md).\n\n## Fresh verification\n\n- Debug GCC build/install passed; all **32 SQL routing/ownership/cleanup tests passed**.\n- The uncommitted `RolledBackUpdateKeepsCommittedOosAfterVacuum` regression **still fails**: original-value readback succeeds after rollback, but returns `-2` after the committed-delete witness proves vacuum progress. This matches the previously recorded CBRD-27237 failure; the relevant vacuum source is unchanged from the PR base. It is not classified as a new routing regression. Per request, the test was left uncommitted and skipped for inclusion.\n- Local CCI is five commits behind the PR's pinned dependency; these local runs do not certify the pinned CCI configuration. No source changes were committed or pushed.\n\n[Full report and execution evidence](https://github.com/vimkim/my-cubrid-docs/blob/08870b103aea34148f08bb9e5d9d9c496d4a4e11/cbrd-27089/review-988a4d2-codex/README.md). The PR body still describes the older two-pass implementation at `b871ea386`; current head uses effective-key routing and an owner-aware first-pass transform.\n\nStandards: 2 optional findings (unused rebuild state is the larger concern). Spec: 3 unmet gates (server lifecycle remains the most consequential).\n","created_at":"2026-09-09T09:40:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/CUBRID/cubrid/pull/7600#issuecomment-5599750448","id":5599750448,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CUBRID/cubrid/issues/7600","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAxqu788AAAABTcVpMA","performed_via_github_app":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CUBRID/cubrid/issues/comments/5599750448/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-09-09T09:40:04Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CUBRID/cubrid/issues/comments/5599750448","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18080546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vimkim","id":18080546,"login":"vimkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDgwNTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vimkim","user_view_type":"public"}}
